WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,750
Shen Xiaotang

2
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:02,400
Today it's your turn to go to Linfeng

3
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:04,160
I I don't dare

4
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:05,280
What's there to be afraid of?

5
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:07,400
You have a sweet mouth and everyone loves to go to Linfeng.

6
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,760
Exchange the things that the sisters should change back to Su Weiwei

7
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:12,280
Why don't you go to Zhao Ya yourself?

8
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:13,600
Wheel hand means Chen Yaoding's

9
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:15,000
Today is Shen Xiaotang

10
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:15,920
Rules are rules

11
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:17,000
Everyone must abide by it

12
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,440
Xiaotang, don’t be afraid

13
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:20,760
Just work when you go, I believe

14
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:22,040
Linfeng will not embarrass you

15
00:00:24,170 --> 00:00:30,890
Then I'll remember it

16
00:00:30,890 --> 00:00:33,250
Whatever he asks you to do, do it and don't talk nonsense.

17
00:00:33,250 --> 00:00:34,490
Don't touch things randomly either

18
00:00:34,490 --> 00:00:37,120
But what should I do if I’m hungry?

19
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:38,240
You insist on persisting

20
00:00:38,240 --> 00:00:40,080
As long as you do your job well, I promise

21
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:42,550
He won't treat you badly, I know

22
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:49,860
Brother Linfeng

23
00:00:49,860 --> 00:00:51,340
it's me today

24
00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:54,330
Xiaotang, come in and be afraid of me

25
00:00:54,950 --> 00:00:56,070
A little bit

26
00:00:56,070 --> 00:00:58,390
But Sister Zhao Ya said you are not a bad person

27
00:00:59,230 --> 00:01:02,390
I didn't give you anything to eat for free. Come on, do your job today.

28
00:01:02,390 --> 00:01:03,710
Just turn these fish over

29
00:01:03,710 --> 00:01:13,080
Good job flipping over until the sun goes down

30
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:16,940
Let's take a rest first

31
00:01:16,940 --> 00:01:18,340
given to me

32
00:01:18,340 --> 00:01:19,460
people who work

33
00:01:19,460 --> 00:01:20,540
Don't even eat

34
00:01:20,540 --> 00:01:28,910
This is a good thing, brother Linfeng

35
00:01:28,910 --> 00:01:30,510
Do you have this every day here?

36
00:01:30,510 --> 00:01:34,260
Every day

37
00:01:34,260 --> 00:01:36,140
The premise is that you have to do your job well.

38
00:01:36,140 --> 00:01:38,980
so much
